# Commit messages

Never add AI or assistant attribution to commit messages, trailers, or commit bodies. Do not add `Co-authored-by` for the assistant, "Generated by", "Written with Cursor", "Made with AI", or anything similar.

Write the message as the author of the change, in the repository's existing style: a short imperative sentence about why the change exists.
